          "number": 8,
          "letter": "H",
          "english": "Since turning it into an organized event in 2015, Donovan has attracted a variety of runners. This year's challenge will feature a far more elite field, which includes Ryan Hall, America's fastest marathon runner. Despite his proven track record, Hall said he has no time goals and that he still suffers from the same fatigue issues that forced him to leave the professional ranks in 2015. Hall plans to run with his friend, Pastor Matthew Barnett of The Dream Center in Los Angeles—one of the six American men who will be competing. \"I don't expect to run a step with Mike, but I will be excited to see how he does,\" said the 34-year-old Hall, who began weight-lifting after retiring. \"If I finish within an hour of him in each marathon, I'd be surprised.\"",
          "chinese": "自2015年将其发展为一项有组织的赛事以来，多诺万吸引了各种各样的跑者。今年的挑战赛将拥有实力强得多的参赛阵容，其中包括美国跑得最快的马拉松运动员瑞安·霍尔。尽管战绩有目共睹，霍尔表示自己没有具体的时间目标，而且仍然受到同样的疲劳问题困扰，正是这个问题迫使他在2015年离开职业赛场。霍尔计划与好友、洛杉矶梦想中心的马修·巴内特牧师一起参赛；巴内特是将参加比赛的六名美国男子之一。“我不指望能和迈克一起跑哪怕一步，但我会很期待看到他的表现。”34岁的霍尔说。他退役后开始进行举重训练。“如果我在每场马拉松中都能在他一小时之内完赛，我都会感到惊讶。”",
